- @kalinin_r1: Support Mikhail Kalinin of the RKP.
- @milyutin_r1: Support Vladimir Milyutin, a known member of the RKP's Conciliator faction.
- @maisky_r1: Support Ivan Maisky.
- @yakubovich_r1: Support Mikhail Yakubovich.
- @radchenko_r1: Support Lyubov Radchenko.
- @cultural_figure: Support a nonpartisan cultural figure?

