@convince_psr_unity
title: Convince the Socialist-Revolutionary Party to support [+ rsdrp_candidate +].
view-if: (rsdrp_candidate = "Nabokov" or rsdrp_candidate = "Rasulzade") and psr_candidate != rsdrp_candidate
on-arrival: {!
Q.psr_support_maisky = 0;
if (Q.psr_relation >= 40 || (Q.psr_relation > 20 && Q.psr_party_leader == "Avksentyev")) {
    Q.psr_support_maisky = 1;
} else if (Q.psr_relation <= 20) {
    Q.psr_support_maisky = 0;
} else {
    Q.psr_support_maisky = 2;
}
!}
max-visits: 1
go-to: psr_failed if psr_support_maisky = 0 or (psr_support_maisky == 2 and historical_mode); psr_success if psr_support_maisky = 1; psr_partial if psr_support_maisky = 2 and not historical_mode

We implore the Socialist-Revolutionary Party to support [+ rsdrp_candidate +] as a unity candidate against fascism, arguing that together, the Trudovaya Koalitsiya can defeat the Solidarists. [? if psr_relation >= 50 : We also remind them of the history of cooperation between our parties, dating back to 1918. ?]


@convince_psr_rsdrp
title: Convince the Socialist-Revolutionary Party to support [+ rsdrp_candidate +].
choose-if: rsdrp_votes >= psr_votes
unavailable-subtitle: [? if rsdrp_votes < psr_votes: The Narodists know that they are more popular than us; they do not see a reason to support our candidate. ?]
