@r2_start
on-arrival: {!
// 1. coordination between the right/far-right
if (Q.Leuchtenberg_votes && Q.Shingarev_votes) {
    if (Q.Leuchtenberg_votes > Q.Shingarev_votes) {
        Q.vs_candidate = "Leuchtenberg";
        Q.other_candidate = "Leuchtenberg";
        Q.Leuchtenberg_bonus = (Q.Leuchtenberg_bonus || 0) - 0.25*Q.other_votes;
        if (Q.psr_candidate == "Chernov") {
            Q.Chernov_bonus = (Q.Chernov_bonus || 0) + 0.25*Q.other_votes;
        }
    } else {
        Q.nts_candidate = "Shingarev";
    }
} else if (Q.Baidalakov_votes && Q.Shingarev_votes) {
    if (Q.Baidalakov_votes > Q.Shingarev_votes) {
        Q.vs_candidate = "Baidalakov";
        Q.other_candidate = "Baidalakov";
    } else {
        Q.nts_candidate = "Shingarev";
    }
}
// 2. If Chernov & Rasulzade are both running and neither are part of the RSDRP coalition, the smaller of these drops out.
Q.chernov_drops_out = 0;
Q.rasulzade_drops_out = 0;
if (Q.psr_candidate == "Chernov" && (Q.musavat_candidate == "Rasulzade" || Q.kadets_candidate == "Rasulzade") && Q.psr_candidate != Q.rsdrp_candidate && (Q.musavat_candidate != Q.rsdrp_candidate || Q.kadets_candidate != Q.rsdrp_candidate)) {
    if (Q.Chernov_votes > Q.Rasulzade_votes) {
        Q.rasulzade_drops_out = 1;
        if (Q.musavat_candidate != Q.rsdrp_candidate) {
            Q.musavat_candidate = "Chernov";
        }
        if (Q.kadets_candidate != Q.rsdrp_candidate) {
            Q.kadets_candidate = "Chernov";
        }
        Q.Chernov_bonus = (Q.Chernov_bonus || 0) + 0.25*Q.other_votes;
    } else {
        Q.chernov_drops_out = 1;
        Q.psr_candidate = "Rasulzade";
        Q.Rasulzade_bonus = 0.25*Q.other_votes;
    }
    if (Q.nts_candidate == 'Shingarev') {
        Q.Shingarev_bonus = (Q.Shingarev_bonus || 0) - 0.25*Q.other_votes;
    } else if (Q.nts_candidate == "Leuchtenberg") {
        Q.Leuchtenberg_bonus = (Q.Leuchtenberg_bonus || 0) - 0.25*Q.other_votes;
    }
}
// kadets drops out to favor the psr candidate
if (Q.kadets_candidate != Q.rsdrp_candidate && Q.kadets_candidate != Q.musavat_candidate && Q.kadets_candidate != Q.psr_candidate) {
}
!}
go-to: r2_menu

In the lead is [+ winner_desc +]. There is no majority in the first round. In the second round, any candidate who wins a plurality will win overall.

[? if vs_candidate = "Leuchtenberg" : The VS and NTS have consolidated their electoral efforts, with the VS now endorsing Leuchtenberg for the second round. Some right-wing voters are uncomfortable with this arrangement, and might not vote. ?]
[? if vs_candidate = "Baidalakov" : The VS and NTS have consolidated their electoral efforts, with the VS now endorsing Baidalakov for the second round. ?]
[? if nts_candidate = "Shingarev" : The VS and NTS have consolidated their electoral efforts, with the NTS now endorsing Shingarev for the second round. ?]

[? if rasulzade_drops_out : The liberal candidate Dr. Andrei Shingarev has dropped out in favor of the Socialist-Revolutionary Party's Viktor Chernov. This consolidates the votes of the moderates, and attracts some votes from the minor liberal parties, at the cost of some conservatives turning to other right-wing candidates. ?]
[? if chernov_drops_out : The Socialist-Revolutionary Party candidate Viktor Chernov has dropped out in favor of the Kadet candidate Dr. Andrei Shingarev. This consolidates the votes of the moderates, and attracts some votes from the right-wing minor parties, however many leftists will likely turn towards other left-wing candidates. ?]

What should we do?

@r2_menu

# convince Müsavat/Kadets/PSR/RKP to endorse our candidate
# change the endorsement, if they aren't endorsing our candidate
# campaign

- @r2_endorse_kalinin
- @r2_endorse_milyutin
- @r2_endorse_chernov
- @r2_endorse_rasulzade
- @r2_endorse_nabokov
- @r2_campaigning: Can we convince any of the parties to change their endorsements?
- @r2_vote: Let the voting begin.

@r2_endorse_kalinin
title: Switch our support to Kalinin of the RKP.
subtitle: This will hurt our party's support.
view-if: rsdrp_candidate != "Kalinin" and rkp_candidate = "Kalinin"
choose-if: rkp_relation >= 50 and left_strength > reformist_strength
unavailable-subtitle: [? if rkp_relation < 50 : We do not have good enough relations with the Communists, so they are not even willing to accept our support. ?] [? if reformist_strength >= left_strength : The reformist faction is able to dissuade the party from supporting this bizarre arrangement. ?]
on-arrival: reformist_dissent += 15; center_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 10; catholics_rsdrp -= 5; workers_rsdrp -= 3; rkp_relation += 10; communist_coalition += 2; psr_relation -= 15; kadets_relation -= 15; musavat_relation -= 12
on-departure: psr_candidate = "Chernov" if psr_candidate = "Maisky" or psr_candidate = "Yakubovich" or psr_candidate = "Radchenko"; musavat_candidate = psr_candidate if musavat_candidate = "Maisky" or musavat_candidate = "Yakubovich" or musavat_candidate = "Radchenko"; kadets_candidate = psr_candidate if kadets_candidate = "Maisky" or kadets_candidate = "Yakubovich" or kadets_candidate = "Radchenko"; rsdrp_candidate = "Kalinin"; 
max-visits: 1

We have switched our endorsement to Mikhail Kalinin of the RKP. [? if psr_candidate = rsdrp_candidate : Our former allies in the Socialist-Revolutionary Party see this as a betrayal. ?][? if psr_candidate = "Maisky" or psr_candidate = "Yakubovich" or psr_candidate = "Radchenko": Now, they will support Viktor Chernov once again. ?][? if musavat_candidate = "Maisky" or musavat_candidate = "Yakubovich" or musavat_candidate = "Radchenko": The [+ musavat_name +] will switch their support to the Socialist-Revolutionary Party candidate. ?][? if kadets_candidate = "Maisky" or kadets_candidate = "Yakubovich" or kadets_candidate = "Radchenko": The K-D will also support the Socialist-Revolutionary Party candidate. ?]

- @r2_vote: Let the voting begin.

