on-arrival: reformist_dissent += 12; center_dissent += 10; labor_dissent += 5; neorevisionist_dissent += 10; catholics_rsdrp -= 5; workers_rsdrp -= 3; rkp_relation += 10; communist_coalition += 2; psr_relation -= 12; musavat_relation -= 10; kadets_relation -= 15; 
on-departure: psr_candidate = "Chernov" if psr_candidate = "Maisky" or psr_candidate = "Yakubovich" or psr_candidate = "Radchenko"; musavat_candidate = psr_candidate if musavat_candidate = "Maisky" or musavat_candidate = "Yakubovich" or musavat_candidate = "Radchenko"; kadets_candidate = psr_candidate if kadets_candidate = "Maisky" or kadets_candidate = "Yakubovich" or kadets_candidate = "Radchenko"; rsdrp_candidate = "Milyutin"; 
max-visits: 1

We have switched our endorsement to Vladimir Milyutin of the RKP. [? if psr_candidate = rsdrp_candidate : Our former allies in the Socialist-Revolutionary Party see this as a betrayal. ?][? if psr_candidate = "Maisky" or psr_candidate = "Yakubovich" or psr_candidate = "Radchenko": Now, they will support Viktor Chernov once again. ?][? if musavat_candidate = "Maisky" or musavat_candidate = "Yakubovich" or musavat_candidate = "Radchenko": The [+ musavat_name +] will switch their support to the Socialist-Revolutionary Party candidate. ?][? if kadets_candidate = "Maisky" or kadets_candidate = "Yakubovich" or kadets_candidate = "Radchenko": The K-D will also support the Socialist-Revolutionary Party candidate. ?]

