@r2_endorse_chernov
title: Switch our support to Viktor Chernov of the Socialist-Revolutionary Party.
view-if: psr_candidate = "Chernov" and rsdrp_candidate != psr_candidate
on-departure: rkp_candidate = "Kalinin" if rkp_candidate == rsdrp_candidate and rkp_party_leader != "Conciliators"; rkp_candidate = "Milyutin" if rkp_candidate == rsdrp_candidate and rkp_party_leader == "Conciliators"; rsrpi_candidate = rkp_candidate; rsdrp_candidate = "Chernov"; psr_relation += 4; Chernov_bonus -= 2.5 if psr_relation < 40; Shingarev_bonus += 2.5 if psr_relation < 40; is_unity_candidate = 1
go-to: r2_campaigning

We have endorsed Viktor Chernov of the Socialist-Revolutionary Party.

[? if psr_relation < 40 : With our support of Chernov, some of the most conservative parts of the Bavarian People's Party have broken away from the Socialist-Revolutionary Party, shifting their support to the Stahlhelm leader Shingarev. ?]

[? if rkp_candidate = rsdrp_candidate: The RKP is now breaking from our previous coalition and supporting their own candidate. ?]


@r2_endorse_rasulzade
title: Switch our support to Dr. Andrei Shingarev.
view-if: musavat_candidate = "Rasulzade" and rsdrp_candidate != musavat_candidate
on-departure: rkp_candidate = "Kalinin" if rkp_candidate == rsdrp_candidate and rkp_party_leader != "Conciliators"; rkp_candidate = "Milyutin" if rkp_candidate == rsdrp_candidate and rkp_party_leader == "Conciliators"; rsrpi_candidate = rkp_candidate; rsdrp_candidate = "Rasulzade"; musavat_relation += 4; kadets_candidate = "Shingarev" if kadets_relation < 40; is_unity_candidate = 1
go-to: r2_campaigning

We have endorsed Dr. Andrei Shingarev, the Conservative Kadet.

[? if rkp_candidate = rsdrp_candidate: The RKP is now breaking from our previous coalition and supporting their own candidate. ?]



@r2_endorse_nabokov
title: Convince the Trudovaya Koalitsiya parties to unite behind Vladimir Nabokov.
subtitle: -2 resources
unavailable-subtitle: [? if resources < 2 : -2 resources - Not enough resources. ?]
choose-if: resources >= 2 and ((psr_relation >= 50 and psr_leader = "Kerensky") or (psr_relation >= 30 and psr_leader = "Avksentyev")) and musavat_relation >= 40
view-if: psr_candidate = "Chernov" and musavat_candidate = "Rasulzade" and rsdrp_candidate != "Nabokov"
on-arrival: rkp_candidate = "Kalinin" if rkp_candidate == rsdrp_candidate and rkp_party_leader != "Conciliators"; rkp_candidate = "Milyutin" if rkp_candidate == rsdrp_candidate and rkp_party_leader == "Conciliators"; rsrpi_candidate = rkp_candidate; rsdrp_candidate = "Nabokov"; psr_candidate = "Nabokov"; musavat_candidate = "Nabokov"; resources -= 2; is_unity_candidate = 1
go-to: r2_campaigning

We have successfully united all of the parties of the Trudovaya Koalitsiya behind Vladimir Nabokov!



